    <briefdescription>
<para>A class for generating noise functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="classhmap_1_1NoiseFunction" kindref="compound">NoiseFunction</ref></computeroutput> class provides an interface for generating noise-based functions. It inherits from the <computeroutput>Function</computeroutput> class and adds parameters for frequency scaling (<computeroutput><ref refid="classhmap_1_1NoiseFunction_1a332703b9642cf219cb6d6e91488648cf" kindref="member">kw</ref></computeroutput>) and a random seed (<computeroutput><ref refid="classhmap_1_1NoiseFunction_1afcc0d96413b1b200fc0ec671e43dcbc3" kindref="member">seed</ref></computeroutput>) to customize the noise generation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
